{{- /* Each section is a named template. The config "sections" list picks the order. */ -}}

{{define "header" -}}
<div align="center">

# {{.Name}}
{{if .Headline}}
### {{.Headline}}
{{end}}
{{- if .Bio}}
{{.Bio}}
{{end}}
{{- if .Badges}}
{{badges .Badges}}
{{end}}
{{badges .StatBadges}}
{{if .Links}}
{{links .Links}}
{{end}}
</div>
{{- end}}

{{define "path" -}}
## Find your path

{{orDefault "Pick an area to explore. Colors group repositories by category, and the same colors are used in every diagram on this page." .Intro.Path}}

{{with index .Images "path"}}<p align="center">
  <img src="{{.}}" alt="Find your path diagram">
</p>{{else}}```mermaid
{{.PathChart}}
```{{end}}

**Legend**

| Color | Category | What it covers | Repos |
|---|---|---|---|
{{- range .Categories}}
| {{.Swatch.Markdown}} | {{cell .Title}} | {{cell .Description}} | {{len .Repos}} |
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

{{define "ecosystem" -}}
{{if .EcosystemChart -}}
## How the projects connect

{{orDefault "Arrows show how the projects build on each other. Node colors match the legend above." .Intro.Ecosystem}}

{{with index .Images "ecosystem"}}<p align="center">
  <img src="{{.}}" alt="How the projects connect diagram">
</p>{{else}}```mermaid
{{.EcosystemChart}}
```{{end}}
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

