{{define "languages" -}}
{{if .Languages.Rows -}}
## Languages

{{orDefault "Bytes of code per language, summed across public repositories with the GitHub languages API. Forks are excluded." .Intro.Languages}}

| Language | Bytes | Share | Repos |
|---|--:|--:|--:|
{{- range .Languages.Rows}}
| {{.Name}} | {{human .Bytes}} | {{pct .Share}} | {{if .Repos}}{{.Repos}}{{end}} |
{{- end}}

{{with index .Images "languages"}}<p align="center">
  <img src="{{.}}" alt="Code by language chart">
</p>{{else}}```mermaid
{{.LanguagePie}}
```{{end}}

<sub>Counted {{human .Languages.TotalBytes}} across the {{.Languages.RepoCount}} repositories that contain code.</sub>
{{- end}}
{{- end}}

